tephenButtolph/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StephenButtolph/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StephenButtolph/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"ae6be159df9aef3af4b0a6c8673ce1d1d394f745","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ava-labs/libevm/commits/ae6be159df9aef3af4b0a6c8673ce1d1d394f745","html_url":"https://github.com/ava-labs/libevm/commit/ae6be159df9aef3af4b0a6c8673ce1d1d394f745"}]},"merge_base_commit":{"sha":"63a0b4c93a12787bfaa60da768b176d3a8a6cd79","node_id":"C_kwDOK0IwXtoAKDYzYTBiNGM5M2ExMjc4N2JmYWE2MGRhNzY4YjE3NmQzYThhNmNkNzk","commit":{"author":{"name":"Arran Schlosberg","email":"519948+ARR4N@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-04-30T13:33:00Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-04-30T13:33:00Z"},"message":"fix: `reentrancy.Guard()` panic on static call (#284)\n\n## Why this should be merged\n\nCould cause a panic on a live chain. This isn't in production anywhere\nso no upgrade is required.\n\n## How this works\n\nChecks for a read-only environment before using the state DB, which\nwould otherwise result in a nil-pointer dereference.\n\nThis actually points to a deeper code smell about\n`vm.PrecompileEnvironment` in that it's too easy to misuse the\n`StateDB()` method. It should probably have its return signature changed\nto `(*state.StateDB, error)` and return `vm.ErrWriteProtection` instead\nof a `nil` DB when in read-only contexts.\n\n## How this was tested\n\nExtended existing integration test to perform a static call to the\nguarded precompile, asserting a `vm.ErrWriteProtection`.","tree":{"sha":"13d9aaee2970511bf89025d6e10eda925aac9e61","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ava-labs/libevm/git/trees/13d9aaee2970511bf89025d6e10eda925aac9e61"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ava-labs/libevm/git/commits/63a0b4c93a12787bfaa60da768b176d3a8a6cd79","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp81oMCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA7IUQACeEv3er3pxwwb51zpHasgB5\nwy7gJk3b2NJm8lVkpu70ZiMLbswO9eM+I40Yd/Gdv8HXlH8Td4c/V6KH4K9IWZmx\n/1sWNIaFfNyAHuB1+WCNtXyy2ocgA1TVS8jNZgHGKlBzjj1L9EWBF3tQ6nuqQ8TR\nlI9aAWT60+djVk7lSBSVy1hrWdnNHnvZooEdWmAcUmlXQGLtGIOnK9bURhi5NDy7\nnCQXu/9VRtg4I44kuqnqLvnEhdRxokrzGuAti2bIt8xR+rCAMl99qcxu8B0AW/jm\naCcAzhOw/wuG8XIOqX3OsLkCgBS98drHyFJWu6m7xSsv3b5DQuEnQ1QBVdZNAF2V\nEfrbfShnKBa6/JV7hJZQfEnR8mz6Pdko1+OlKOwqX/55yragnRcZkRX4RPxcBAED\nWooryAETY9VruSQKnp5kyJ9qmKJ/av/DBSaGOuV3r6avKYUYoukw7JrvJyQDMfRr\nhP40hLvLk8paaR5z/B8+dqxxYR3ZRVn6ppWtKbojXi/icWkpRpKXFplo0q8JE8gJ\n8pjAzpSapu7iPKnZh+nx/BpQ10oV8wCo1fmO/MLAKGc9HyPyRrBoRJ1Tb5/VSLed\nmlefOzj7I1j79yv0q1CO1aTBovxe5MFQgLBwrZfD9OdMrowfs/Eadn6zx8rP504q\nP2GBEmYOJtk07ZvAqQeH\n=XDVx\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 13d9aaee2970511bf89025d6e10eda925aac9e61\nparent d28ed668eab0f8be36927d1f146d627f539d69ab\nauthor Arran Schlosberg <519948+ARR4N@users.noreply.github.com> 1777555980 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1777555980 -0400\n\nfix: `reentrancy.Guard()` panic on static call (#284)\n\n## Why this should be merged\n\nCould cause a panic on a live chain. This isn't in production anywhere\nso no upgrade is required.\n\n## How this works\n\nChecks for a read-only environment before using the state DB, which\nwould otherwise result in a nil-pointer dereference.\n\nThis actually points to a deeper code smell about\n`vm.PrecompileEnvironment` in that it's too easy to misuse the\n`StateDB()` method. It should probably have its return signature changed\nto `(*state.StateDB, error)` and return `vm.ErrWriteProtection` instead\nof a `nil` DB when in read-only contexts.\n\n## How this was tested\n\nExtended existing integration test to perform a static call to the\nguarded precompile, asserting a `vm.ErrWriteProtection`.","verified_at":"2026-04-30T13:33:00Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ava-labs/libevm/commits/63a0b4c93a12787bfaa60da768b176d3a8a6cd79","html_url":"https://github.com/ava-labs/libevm/commit/63a0b4c93a12787bfaa60da768b176d3a8a6cd79","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ava-labs/libevm/commits/63a0b4c93a12787bfaa60da768b176d3a8a6cd79/comments","author":{"login":"ARR4N","id":519948,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxOTk0OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/519948?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ARR4N","html_url":"https://github.com/ARR4N","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ARR4N/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ARR4N/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ARR4N/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ARR4N/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ARR4N/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ARR4N/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ARR4N/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ARR4N/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.githu